# Studio desk (/curate). Leave these unset and the public catalog still builds.
# On Vercel, set both in the project’s environment variables. Never commit the values.
# STUDIO_PASSWORD is what Thomasene types. STUDIO_GITHUB_TOKEN is a fine-grained
# GitHub token for this repository only, with Contents set to Read and write.
STUDIO_PASSWORD=
STUDIO_GITHUB_TOKEN=
# Optional. Defaults are the public repository and the main branch.
# STUDIO_GITHUB_REPO=dblevins-3dgfx/artist-portfolio
# STUDIO_GITHUB_BRANCH=main
